{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o142","title":"太祖以孙权称臣遣贡咨王朗，朗答孙权前笺自诡躬讨虏、后疏称臣以明无二，情见乎辞、效著乎功","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-b6186e8616e21d612ccf","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"太祖以孙权称臣遣贡咨王朗，朗答孙权前笺自诡躬讨虏、后疏称臣以明无二，情见乎辞、效著乎功","evidence":["zhonghua-q-ff1c96fb3e6e1fcea93f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"咨问者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-ff1c96fb3e6e1fcea93f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0309","role":"答者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-ff1c96fb3e6e1fcea93f"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"所称臣之吴主","evidence":["zhonghua-q-ff1c96fb3e6e1fcea93f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-ff1c96fb3e6e1fcea93f"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-ff1c96fb3e6e1fcea93f","source_order":[13,246,87],"order":2904}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0309","name":"王朗","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-ff1c96fb3e6e1fcea93f","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-4fe2ec6a24ca4e7ec9d5","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖以孙权称臣遣贡，咨朗。朗答曰：‘孙权前笺，自诡躬讨虏以补前愆；后疏称臣，以明无二。牙兽屈膝，言鸟告欢；明珠、南金，远珍必至。情见乎辞，效著乎功。三江五湖，为沼于魏；西吴东越，化为国民。鄢、郢既拔，荆门自开；席卷巴、蜀，形势已成。重休累庆，杂沓相随。承旨之日，抚掌击节：情之蓄者，辞不能宣！’","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":245,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-672fe3a928f24010e141","start":87,"end":234,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
